description:
Design a 32-bit multiplier circuit that computes the result of the input value multiplied by 8. The module performs various shifts and additions to achieve the final product. It utilizes a combination of bitwise operations and arithmetic assignments to effectively multiply the input by a scaling factor, ultimately outputting the computed result.
module top_module(
    i_data0,
    o_data0
);

