description:
Implement an 8-element array multiplier that takes two 256-bit wide input arrays (array1 and array2) and produces a 32-bit wide output (res). The circuit performs pairwise multiplication of corresponding 32-bit segments from the input arrays, resulting in eight 32-bit partial products. These partial products are then summed in stages to yield a single 32-bit result, effectively providing the cumulative product of the relevant segments of both arrays.
module top_module(
	input [255:0] array1,
	input [255:0] array2,
	output [31:0] res
);

